        <span class="deets-mobile-copy">I’m drawn to experimental design, visual friction, and identities that refuse a single tone. Design isn’t neutral decoration: it carries culture, ideology, and power. At its best, it doesn’t just change how something looks—it changes how it can be read, felt, and remembered.</span>
